  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">230001356 reference WB TF025866 International Development Association 20th replenishment/Debt Relief Trust Fund HIPC Additional Contributions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a part of the outcome of the IDA20 negotiations (resolution), the Netherlands has pledged its commitment and a contribution of EUR 837,02 million, of which EUR 9,11 million is an additional contribution for debt relief in the form of a grant for the HIPC window of the Debt Relief Trust Fund (the &#x201C;HIPC Additional Contributions&#x201D;). To facilitate the integrated management of the portfolio of the Dutch effort for debt relief and debt management, this financial contribution to IDA20 is part of the BHOS budget. The core contribution to IDA20 is transferred by the Ministry of Finance.</narrative>
  </description>
